<title>UK: WestLB sets warrants on the DAX and MDAX.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets warrants on the DAX and MDAX.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westdeutsche Landesbank says it has issued 390 million American-style call and put warrants, in marks, in 39 equal tranches, on the DAX and MDAX indices.</p>
<p>There are 27 tranches on the DAX (15 calls and 12 puts) and 12 tranches on the MDAX (7 calls and 5 puts).</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE 14.FEB.97	 LISTING DDF FFT	 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
